SUMMARY:Metallic Watercolors: an ATC Workshop
LOCATION:211 South Howard Ave Tampa \, FL 33606 United States
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a Fall inspired watercolor workshop making artist tradin
 g cards (ATCs) and small zines with pearlescent paint on black paper. Embe
 llish extra details with color pencils. Artist Trading Cards are 2.5 x 3.5
  and fun to make\, trade\, give as gifts or leave in hidden places as a su
 rprise to the finder. You can paint them\, draw them\,and even collage the
 m. Zines are small booklets that can also be traded\, mailed and used in l
 etter writing. Play and choose your theme: Halloween\, Fall Leaves\, Abstr
 acts...or try them all. Instructions and reference materials will be provi
 ded. Each student receives their own small kit to take home and continue t
 he Fall ATC fun. It includes: 1. Pearlescent watercolor palette with 20 co
 lors 2. Round paintbrush 3. White Prismacolor pencil 3. Blank cards to wor
 k on at home 4. A spooky folder to hold it all! \n\nPermalink: https://www
 .tampa.gov/node/195276
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/195276
END:VEVENT
