SUMMARY:Studio 55: Daytime Choir
LOCATION:120 W Gasparilla Plaza Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Mondays\, Oct 5 - Nov 16  9:30 AM  11:00 AM (7 classes) Grand 
 Performance  Sunday\, Nov 22  2:00 PM  3:00 PM Ages 55  Beginner-Intermedi
 ate Level The Master Chorale of Tampa Bay invites you to join the Daytime 
 Choir. In this eight-week\, adults 55 and older will learn to sing and hav
 e fun with others. Each week features a choir rehearsal\, a coffee hour\, 
 and plenty of opportunities to share in music and conversation. Together\,
  we can build a warm and welcoming community that celebrates creativity\, 
 friendship\, and the joy of singing. Whether youve sung in choirs for year
 s or are discovering group singing for the first time\, MCTBs Daytime Choi
 r is a place to experience the joy and power of choral music! This program
  will meet for seven Monday rehearsal sessions followed by a culminating p
 erformance on Sunday\, November 22\, 2026. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tamp
 a.gov/node/193676
