LOCATION:120 West Gasparilla Plaza\, Tampa\, FL 33602\, USA Tampa \, FL 33
 602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Select Wednesdays  9:30-10:30 AM Classes Available  923\, 1021
 \, 1118\, 1216 Ages 2  Beginner-Intermediate Level Growing Creativity: Ear
 ly Leaners Gallery and Art Experience introduces toddlers and caregivers t
 o the joy of making art together. Children ages 2-5 will develop creativit
 y\, curiosity\, and early motor skills by exploring color\, texture\, and 
 movement through hands-on sensory activities and collaborative art making.
  Using safe\, tactile materials such as paint\, natural elements\, and sim
 ple tools\, participants focus on process\, discovery\, and playful experi
