SUMMARY:Going With Grace
LOCATION:3751 E Fowler Ave Tampa \, FL 33905 United States
DESCRIPTION:LiveLung\, a nonprofit organization dedicated to supporting lu
 ng cancer patients\, survivors\, and their care partners\, invites the Tam
 pa area lung cancer community to its monthly support and educational meeti
 ng on Wednesday\, October 21st at 11:00 a.m. The meeting will be held at H
 oliday Inn Tampa North\, 3751 E Fowler Ave\, Tampa \, and includes a delic
 ious complimentary lunch. Allissa Hopkins ispresenting\, Going with Grace.
  Hopkins is a certified death doula with the Florida End-of-Life Alliance.
  A death doula provides nonmedical emotional\, spiritual\, and practical s
 upport to people who are nearing the end of life and to their families. So
 meone like Hopkins fills the gaps that medical care doesnt cover\, like si
 tting with someone during their final hours\, helping them create meaningf
 ul projects to leave behind\, guiding families through grief\, and simply 
 being a consistent\, calm presence during one of lifes most difficult tran
 sitions. Florida End-of-Life Doula Alliance is a statewide non-profit that
  helps doulas support\, empower\, educate\, and serve our communities. Liv
 eLungs educational meetings provide valuable resources and opportunities f
 or lung cancer patients\, survivors\, and their care partners to learn\, n
 etwork\, and build community . Each meeting features an expert guest speak
 er who shares insights to empower attendees with knowledge and support. Lu
 ng cancer patients and their care partners are welcome to learn more and r
 egister at https:www.livelung.orgmeetingstampa or call 877.311.LUNG (5864)
  . \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/195331
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/195331
END:VEVENT
